%G-code: VTP1.tap
%------------------ PROGRAM SETTING ------------------
G21    %metric units
G94    %millimeters per minute feedrate
G90    %absolute distance mode w.r.t active coord. sys.
%------------------ FOAM LOADING ------------------
G0 X 0.00000 Y 0.00000 Z 0.00000 A 0.00000   %machine home
G0 X 60.00000 Y 38.50000 Z 60.00000 A 38.50000    %front of billet
M1     %program temporary stop
%LOAD BILLET IN THE MACHINE AND PRESS CYCLE START (GREEN BUTTON) WHEN READY.
%Hot wire should be at middle depth of the billet. If your part is tapered, pay special attention to the billet position in between heads.
%------------------ CUT PREPARATION ------------------
G0 X 50.00000 Y 38.50000 Z 50.00000 A 38.50000
M1     %program temporary stop
%TURN ON THE HOT WIRE CURRENT/VOLTAGE AND PRESS CYCLE START (GREEN BUTTON) WHEN READY.
G4 P5
